# AI Frontier RKE lab: pipeline code, documents and run receipts are tracked; artifacts are not.
# validated != published. Canonical drafts, worker outputs, MACR task files and third-party
# repository excerpts (RepoLumen manifests, grounding bundles) stay local until a publication
# event (RELEASE_GATES G0-G10 + human review) says otherwise. Receipts (numbers, hashes) are kept.
slice-*/artifacts/
slice-*/worker_runs/
slice-*/tasks/
slice-*/canonical/
slice-*/validation/
slice-*/REPORT.md
slice-*/*.log
repolumen-cache/
mock/
pipeline.v1-backup-*/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
step3.err
step3.out
slice-*/packets/
NEW_SESSION_PROMPT.md
pipeline/local_paths.json
canary/*.log
canary/**/*.log
canary/**/previews/
